## Impact
rewardPerToken() in EUSDMiningIncentives does not account for boost leading to an inflated rewardPerTokenStored, since stakers with boost can claim more but stakers without boost would claim the same 1x per distributed.

Assume there are 100 LBR to be distributed to 1000 LPToken in a period of X.
