    uint256 reward = rewards[user];
    if (reward > 0) {
        rewards[user] = 0;
        //...
        IesLBR(esLBR).mint(msg.sender, reward);
        //...
    }
}

```

In the purchaseOtherEarnings function, the user parameter denotes the address whose rewards are to be claimed. If the user's rewards are eligible for claim (isOtherEarningsClaimable(user) returns true), the rewards of the user are claimed by the caller of the function (msg.sender), effectively allowing the caller to steal the user's rewards without incurring any cost.

